#N canvas 0 0 1700 2700 10;
#X text 20 20 mlrv-gui.pd -- literal mapping GUI + full instrument (1:1 mlrv recreation item 5 \, increment 2). widgets send engine messages directly (always live) \; MIDI/OSC/key go through mapper.pd (learn buttons arm params). run WITH a display: mlrv-pd/run_mlrv_gui.sh. headless: run_mlrv_gui_test.sh.;
